---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Contact – Vermont Fire Stations</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none">
            <path
              d="M12 2.5c1.1 2.6-1.4 3.9-1.7 6.3-.2 1.7.9 3.2 2.6 3.2.4 0 .8-.1 1.1-.3-.3 2-2.1 3.5-4.2 3.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 1-4.3-4.3c0-3.6 2.9-5 3.6-7.7.3 1 .1 2-.4 2.8 1.6-.8 2.7-2.2 3.3-3.5Z"
              fill="currentColor"
            />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="wordmark">
          <span class="title">Vermont Fire Stations</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1>Contact</h1>

      <p>Vermont Fire Stations is an independent project cataloguing fire department
        stations across the state — photos, locations, and a few fun facts.</p>

      <p>Spot an error, have a correction, or want to share a photo of your local
        station? Open an issue on GitHub and it'll get a look:</p>

      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/thomasgarvey/fdvt-2/issues" rel="noopener">
          github.com/thomasgarvey/fdvt-2/issues →
        </a>
      </p>

      <p><a href="/">← Back to the map</a></p>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Vermont Fire Stations</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --red: #c62828;
    --ink: #2b2b2b;
    --paper: #faf7f2;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  html,
  body {
    height: 100%;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  header {
    padding: 0.65rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--red);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(43, 43, 43, 0.08);
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .badge {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  main h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  main a {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #6b6257;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-top: 1px solid #e7ded2;
  }
  footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  footer a:hover {
    color: var(--red);
  }
</style>
